  <title>BBC1 documentary on Music and Emotions</title>
  <link>http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/news-bbc1</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;BBC1 documentary on Music and Emotions&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;&lt;span lang="" about="http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/user/1" typeof="schema:Person" property="schema:name" datatype="" xml:lang=""&gt;mathieub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Tue, 27/11/2012 - 15:21&lt;/span&gt;

            &lt;div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The BBC1 documentary on Music and Emotions (Imagine series) which includes parts being filmed during the CMMR 2012 conference at Queen Mary and Wilton's Music Hall will be broadcasted on Tuesday 27th November 2012 on BBC 1 at 22.35.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
      </description>
