<item>
  <title>Best paper rewards from the Cognitive Science Society and I Like Music</title>
  <link>http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/news-rewards</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;Best paper rewards from the Cognitive Science Society and I Like Music&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;&lt;span lang="" about="http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/user/1" typeof="schema:Person" property="schema:name" datatype="" xml:lang=""&gt;mathieub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Mon, 16/07/2012 - 12:16&lt;/span&gt;

            &lt;div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;
	The best paper reward from the &lt;span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, 'Bitstream Vera Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; "&gt;Cognitive Science Society &lt;/span&gt;has been attributed to Erik Schmidt for his paper: "&lt;a href="http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/sites/cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/files/pdf/papers/cmmr2012_submission_87.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;Relating Perceptual and Feature Space Invariances in Music Emotion Recognition&lt;/a&gt;" (Erik Schmidt, Matthew Prockup, Jeffrey Scott, Brian Dolhansky, Brandon Morton and Youngmoo Kim).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	The best paper reward from I Like Music on &lt;span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, 'Bitstream Vera Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; "&gt;Music and Emotions &lt;/span&gt;has been attributed to &lt;span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, 'Bitstream Vera Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; "&gt;Matt McVicar for his paper "&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/sites/cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/files/pdf/papers/cmmr2012_submission_61.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;CCA and Multi-way Extension for Investigating Common Components Between Audio, Lyrics and Tags&lt;/a&gt;" (Matt McVicar and Tijl De Bie).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Congratulations to &lt;span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, 'Bitstream Vera Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; "&gt;Erik Schmidt&lt;/span&gt; and Matt McVicar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
      </description>
  <pubDate>Mon, 16 Jul 2012 11:16:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>mathieub</dc:creator>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">83 at http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk</guid>
    </item>
