<item>
  <title>BBT rock band @ CMMR 2012</title>
  <link>http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/news-bbt</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;BBT rock band @ CMMR 2012&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;&lt;span lang="" about="http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/user/1" typeof="schema:Person" property="schema:name" datatype="" xml:lang=""&gt;mathieub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Tue, 15/05/2012 - 00:44&lt;/span&gt;

            &lt;div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;
	We are very pleased to announce that French rock band &lt;a href="http://soundcloud.com/bbt_band" target="_blank"&gt;BBT&lt;/a&gt; will perform during CMMR 2012:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;
		On Thursday 21st June 2012, after the Gala Dinner at &lt;a href="http://underthebridge.co.uk/" target="_blank"&gt;Under The Bridge&lt;/a&gt; (before the Open Jam Session), and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
		On Friday 22nd June 2012 at &lt;a href="http://wiltons.org.uk/" target="_blank"&gt;Wilton's Music Hall&lt;/a&gt; (9 to 10 pm) during the &lt;a href="http://cmmr2012.eecs.qmul.ac.uk/new-resonances"&gt;New Resonances CMMR 2012 Festival&lt;/a&gt;, featuring &lt;a href="http://www.lma.cnrs-mrs.fr/" target="_blank"&gt;CNRS-LMA&lt;/a&gt;'s Future Drums project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;
	 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	&lt;a href="http://soundcloud.com/bbt_band" target="_blank"&gt;BBT band&lt;/a&gt; is composed of:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	&lt;a href="http://www.myspace.com/faridmedjane" target="_blank"&gt;Farid Medjane&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trust_(band)" target="_blank"&gt;Trust&lt;/a&gt;, more than 4 million records sold) - drums&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	&lt;a href="http://www.myspace.com/boro7" target="_blank"&gt;Daniel Borowczak&lt;/a&gt; - guitar&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	&lt;a href="http://www.myspace.com/niagaraboro" target="_blank"&gt;Niagara&lt;/a&gt; - vocals, bass guitar&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
      </description>
